<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9816"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 28, 2005 - 9:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Most everyone who has participated as regular posters have hung in there for the long haul. One very knowledgeable and interesting poster has been noticably absent: Teardrop. Where is teardrop ?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
