<!--Post: 9818--><!--Time: 1109653828-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9818"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 28, 2005 - 9:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Teardrop is absent Tac but where have you been? We are doing a roll call over in the BTK Communications page under the thread &#39;Was BTK Posting Here/Roll Call&#39; started by Topsailgirl. <BR>You will find many of the posters have checked in. Get over there yourself and you better have a good excuse for being tardy.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9818-->
<!--Post: 9833--><!--Time: 1109657047-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9833"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 28, 2005 - 10:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yes, and just lately there seems to be a party goin&#39; on all up in dere. <BR> <BR>And it&#39;s most decidedly <b>OFF THA CHAIN!</b><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9833-->
