<!--Post: 9883--><!--Time: 1109688005-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9883"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 6:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Teardrop is still here. I guess the BTK trip is off? As the dust settles on the BTK case, I hope that Tom takes up another case, so we can press onward and continue sleuthing. I never realized how obsessed I was with thoughts and time until he was arrested. Now what do I do? <BR> <BR>Perhaps we should suggest different cases for Tom to review. Tom? <BR> <BR>2 1/2 weeks ago, I had 3 rabbits. Now I have 19. I guess that I will be hopping down the bunny trail, following BTK developments, and waiting for Tom&#39;s next move. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
